,{},{},{},{},{}],"verses":["18:35","18:36","18:37","18:38","18:39","18:40","18:41","18:42","18:43"],"en":{"18:35":"As Jesus drew near to Jericho, a blind man was sitting beside the road, begging.","18:36":"When he heard the crowd going by, he asked what was happening.","18:37":"“Jesus of Nazareth is passing by,” they told him.","18:38":"So he called out, “Jesus, Son of David, have mercy on me!”","18:39":"Those who led the way admonished him to be silent, but he cried out all the louder, “Son of David, have mercy on me!”","18:40":"Jesus stopped and directed that the man be brought to Him. When he had come near, Jesus asked him,","18:41":"“What do you want Me to do for you?” “Lord,” he said, “let me see again.”","18:42":"“Receive your sight!” Jesus replied. “Your faith has healed you.”","18:43":"Immediately he received his sight and followed Jesus, glorifying God. And all the people, when they saw it, gave praise to God."}}},"pairs":{"mt-mk":{"exact":26,"lemma":20,"pctA":58.2,"pctB":37.4,"run":4,"runText":"καὶ στὰς ὁ Ἰησοῦς"},"mt-lk":{"exact":20,"lemma":14,"pctA":43.0,"pctB":31.5,"run":3,"runText":"παρὰ τὴν ὁδόν"},"mk-lk":{"exact":53,"lemma":2,"pctA":44.7,"pctB":50.9,"run":8,"runText":"δὲ πολλῷ μᾶλλον ἔκραζεν Υἱὲ Δαυίδ ἐλέησόν με"}},"minor":[{"mt":59,"lk":76,"l":3,"word":"Κύριε","gloss":"Lord","content":1,"sig":1}]}